35,2,1,talk,Minako,,The timing shows 102 minutes per pass. The calendar shows two people away often.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The kitchen watch confirms two people do 90% of the cooking. The absences match.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The grout gets dirty in 11 days. ""Done"" means different things to everyone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The spray costs 2,300 yen monthly. The office cleaner is 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
