40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, if two people cook, should they clean more?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logically, yes. But the absences mean the present ones carry the load.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
