43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"4,200 yen an hour is expensive. 102 minutes is almost two hours.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,The previous tenants' silence is a warning. We must avoid that.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"102 minutes is significant. If we hire out, it's nearly 8,400 yen.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"That is high. But if we rotate, the absent ones still owe their share.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I don't want to guess. I want a clear rule.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I can handle the money if we are clear on who pays what.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A clear rule prevents the sideways complaints.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,I am leaning towards a fixed schedule to remove the guesswork.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,A fixed rota accounts for absences if we swap.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I like the idea of knowing who is responsible.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shizue,,I am fine with a rota if the costs are shared fairly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us choose the option that preserves our peace.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
